#: ../../source/users/folio/type/multiline_diagram.rst:5
msgid "Multiline diagram"
msgstr "多线图"

#: ../../source/users/folio/type/multiline_diagram.rst:7
msgid ""
"The multiline diagrams represent electric, fluid, etc. systems including all"
" details: terminals, all phases, power and control system, etc."
msgstr "多线图表示电气、流体等系统，包含所有细节：端子、全部相线、动力与控制系统等。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/type/multiline_diagram.rst:9
msgid "`Multiline conductors`_ are used to draw single line diagrams."
msgstr "`多线导体 <Multiline conductors_>`_ 用于绘制单线图。"

